## Critical Pitfalls to Avoid

1. ❌ Writing code before .storekit file
2. ❌ No Transaction.updates listener
3. ❌ Forgetting transaction.finish()
4. ❌ No restore button (App Store rejection)
5. ❌ Ignoring refunds (revocationDate)

